# Too Many Chefs (bastok 86): Ferghus' guard xi.settings.main.ENABLE_WOTG == 1 with the setting a boolean: Lua's
# `true == 1` is false: with fame level 5 the offer is still not made (420). A port that reads true as 1
# (Settings.MainNumber / Main) would offer it (946); Settings.MainEquals (quest rework P9) does not. Then 1: 946, finished
# on 1 (not begun: the finish begins on 0 only). Recorded on Lua at 9ab47b5a^ (the parent of the commit that ported the
# quest).
char zone=Metalworks pos=-23,-10,-27
setting ENABLE_WOTG true
login
fame Bastok 325                 # fame level 5
trigger Ferghus                 # ENABLE_WOTG true: not offered, 420
finish-if-event
setting ENABLE_WOTG 1
trigger Ferghus                 # ENABLE_WOTG 1: 946
finish option=1                 # not begun
